  data: {
    LLM: 'Each player receives three hole cards face down. Preflop betting. Dealer deals three community cards (flop); betting. Each active player must discard one hole card. Dealer deals one card (turn); betting. Dealer deals one card (river); final betting. Showdown: best five-card hand using any two hole cards and five board cards wins.',
    Player: 'Each player receives three hole cards face down. Preflop betting. Dealer deals three community cards (flop); betting. Each active player must discard one hole card. Dealer deals one card (turn); betting. Dealer deals one card (river); final betting. Showdown: best five-card hand using any two hole cards and five board cards wins.',
    objective: 'Make the best five-card poker hand from your two remaining hole cards and the five community cards to win the pot.',
    gameplay: 'Each player receives three hole cards face down. Preflop betting. Dealer deals three community cards (flop); betting. Each active player must discard one hole card. Dealer deals one card (turn); betting. Dealer deals one card (river); final betting. Showdown: best five-card hand using any two hole cards and five board cards wins.',
    keyRules: [
      'Three hole cards; discard one before the turn.',
      "Five community cards (flop, turn, river) as in Texas Hold'em.",
      'Standard poker hand ranking; best five-card hand wins the pot.',
      'Blinds and betting rounds: preflop, after flop, after turn, after river.',
